## type.coll.13: reading the pending map while assigning to it used to panic
## the checker (it settled the local twice). The value gives no known value type
## (lists have no `+`), so the store reports type.coll.13, not a list index error (ADR 1135).
fn main()
    mut m := {}
    m["a"] = (m.get("a") else []) + ["x"]
    print(m)
